Editions
--------

Running one server for many organisations (multi-tenancy) is AgentAction's
Enterprise feature. Its code — tenants, per-tenant keys, branding, rules and
webhooks, and the operator client in the SDK — is in this repository and is
Apache-2.0 like the rest of it: you may run as many tenants as you like on your
own installation. What the Enterprise plan sells is the support, onboarding,
SLA and hosting around it, not permission to use this code.

Anything built only for a hosted service in future — an operator console,
billing, SSO — would not be part of this repository and would not be covered by
this licence.

